fixture tech12_kindle_dash_away_does_not_ignite
doc Task 3 review round 2, L12: BUILD.md s5 tech 12 "Kindle-dash: dash through a wax wall or a Snuffed to ignite it". Standing flush against the wax wall's right face and dashing right, away from it: the dash never goes through the wax, so it does not ignite it (the dash reaches a sub-pixel further only on the side it moves toward).
room test/wax
spawn 842 544
option kindle 1
frames 30
input
  0 R dash
  1..29 R
end
expect
  at 0 event.dash=1
  never 0..29 event.ignite=1
end
